## 2. Platform Foundation Mapping Matrix

| Foundation Pillar | Android Implementation | iOS Implementation | React Native Implementation |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Design System & Theme** | Material 3 `@Composable` Tokens | SwiftUI `Theme` Environment | Encapsulated StyleSheet Design Tokens |
| **Config & Feature Flags** | Hilt `AppConfig` + RemoteConfig | SPM `AppConfig` + RemoteConfig | Context Provider `useConfig()` |
| **Security & Cryptography** | Android KeyStore + EncryptedPrefs | iOS Keychain Services | `react-native-keychain` / SecureStore |
| **Localization (i18n)** | `res/values/strings.xml` | `Localizable.xcstrings` (Catalog) | `i18next` / `react-i18next` |
| **Observability & Logging** | Timber / OpenTelemetry SDK | OSLog / Unified Logging System | Sentry / Datadog RN SDK |

