## 3. Mandatory Foundation Rules

<div style="border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3); background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.04); border-left: 5px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px 24px; margin: 28px 0;">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
    <span style="background: #ef4444; color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">NON-NEGOTIABLE</span>
    <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); font-weight: 700;">Foundation Compliance Violations</h3>
  </div>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;">
    <div style="background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">1. Zero Hardcoded Raw Colors</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">Never hardcode hex values like <code>#008544</code> inside UI views. Always reference design tokens from the core theme provider.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">2. Zero Unencrypted Key-Value Storage</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">Never store OAuth tokens or secret keys in unencrypted storage (SharedPreferences, UserDefaults, or AsyncStorage). Use Keychain/KeyStore.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">3. Zero Hardcoded String Literals</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">UI text must never contain raw English strings. All text must be sourced from localization resource files for multi-language support.</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">4. Mandatory Error Tracking & Logging</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">All non-fatal exceptions and network failure states must be logged through the centralized telemetry foundation wrapper.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

